          "value": "<p>To my master and lord Abu ZikrI\u2014may God prolong his life\u2014</p>\n<p>Ibn Sighmar\u2014may God be his protector.</p>\n<p>the dear, R. Judah, son of R. Moses, (may he) r{est in) E(den),</p>\n<p></p>",
